      "source": "Turns the <a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a> into a <code>Document</code> within the given\n<a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationOperationContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将给定的 <a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a> 转换为 <code>Document</code>，该转换在指定的 <a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationOperationContext</code></a> 中进行。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Append the given key at the position in the underlying <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/LinkedHashMap.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>LinkedHashMap</code></a>.",
